# Symlinks agents left in ported_implementation/: targets inside the container
# (/usr/local/lib, /target), a loop (node_modules/gbnf -> ..), or a venv alias.
# DVC cannot store a dangling link and would follow the loop. The zip keeps them.
**/node_modules/vitest
**/node_modules/gbnf
**/.venv/bin/python
**/.venv/bin/python3
**/.venv/bin/python3.14
**/.venv/lib64
